@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam actorBorderColor #17324D
skinparam actorFontColor #17324D
skinparam usecase {
 BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
}
skinparam rectangle {
 BorderColor #94A3B8
 FontColor #17324D
}
title Resumefolio | Actor goals and use-case overview
actor "Applicant / resource owner" as applicant
actor "Employer viewer\n(no product account)" as viewer
actor "Authorized work / repository participant" as participant
actor "Invited collaborator" as invitee
actor "Authorized workflow actor\n(grants to define)" as workflow
actor "Authorized administrator / platform owner" as admin
actor "Authorized operator" as operator
rectangle "Resumefolio | System boundary" {
 usecase "UC-D01\nTailor professional presentation" as tailor [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d01]]
 usecase "UC-D02\nConfigure PDF and sharing" as share [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d02]]
 usecase "UC-D03\nView selected protected material" as view [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d03]]
 usecase "UC-D04\nPrepare and track an application" as prepare [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d04]]
 usecase "UC-D05\nPreserve actual submitted materials" as capture [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d05]]
 usecase "UC-D06\nUse authorized mail and calendar" as communicate [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d06]]
 usecase "UC-D07\nRefine work and plan Sprints" as plan [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d07]]
 usecase "UC-D08\nAccept scoped collaboration" as join [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d08]]
 usecase "UC-D09\nUse real Git collaboration" as git [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09]]
 usecase "UC-D10\nRun work / separately control deployment" as run [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d10]]
 usecase "UC-D11\nConfigure policy / inspect evidence" as policy [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d11]]
 usecase "UC-D12\nRestore and reconcile safely" as restore [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d12]]
}
applicant -- tailor
applicant -- share
applicant -- prepare
applicant -- capture
applicant -- communicate
viewer -- view
participant -- plan
participant -- git
invitee -- join
workflow -- run
admin -- policy
operator -- restore
legend bottom
12 existing goal bundles. Focused diagrams refine independent operations.
One person may hold several contexts; grants remain resource/action-specific.
Execution and restoration remain subject to their existing feasibility/authority gates.
Associations show proposed external interactions, not permission grants.
No include/extend dependency or actor inheritance is asserted.
endlegend
@enduml
